\">Motorized LED Mini Spotlight (Rotating Head)</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"8mg8d\\\\\\">7 LEDs (8W each)</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"5nqvc\\\\\\">4-in-1 (red, green, blue, white)</li></ul>\\", \\"price_equipment\\": \\"25 Gel/ps\\", \\"youtube_link\\": \\"\\", \\"promou_equipment\\": \\"Elevate the romance on your special day with our exquisite LED spotlights for weddings. Create a magical ambiance, highlight key moments, and turn your wedding into a visually stunning celebration that will be remembered forever\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"fae7635e-ff44-4740-9bc5-a2ce73e0ca7f\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"eqipment_cards\\", \\"value\\": {\\"name_equipment\\": \\"DMX Fog Machine\\", \\"pfoto_equipment\\": 470, \\"smallname_equipment\\": \\"\\", \\"description_equipment\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"umi6n\\\\\\"><b>Stairville AF-150</b></p>\\", \\"characteristic_equipment\\": \\"<ul><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"a3uk1\\\\\\">Heating element: Electronic vaporiser with 800 W</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"1c3q6\\\\\\">Warm-up time: Approximately 8 min</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"8imfs\\\\\\">Fluid consumption: Approximately 33 ml / min</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"7pf7v\\\\\\">Emission volume: Approximately 110 m\\\\u00b3 / min</li></ul>\\", \\"price_equipment\\": \\"60 Gel\\", \\"youtube_link\\": \\"\\", \\"promou_equipment\\": \\"Elevate your event in Batumi with our cutting-edge smoke generators! Transform any space into a captivating scene by renting our high-quality dymogenators. Add a touch of mystique and immerse your audience in an atmosphere that captivates. Make your celebration or performance truly unforgettable with the magic of professional smoke generators, all available for rent in the beautiful city of Batumi\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"cd61670e-fb16-48a1-9e31-aac679a0fb25\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"eqipment_cards\\", \\"value\\": {\\"name_equipment\\": \\"DMX Fog Machine\\", \\"pfoto_equipment\\": 463, \\"smallname_equipment\\": \\"\\", \\"description_equipment\\": \\"<p data-block-k