ties, and effects to enhance the mood and ambiance of your venue\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"52f7fe6e-66d3-46f1-b9ef-b03c0b4df675\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"eqipment_cards\\", \\"value\\": {\\"name_equipment\\": \\"pro Controllers\\", \\"pfoto_equipment\\": 467, \\"smallname_equipment\\": \\"\\", \\"description_equipment\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"0fq3l\\\\\\"><b>Wolfmix W1</b></p>\\", \\"characteristic_equipment\\": \\"<ul><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"n3nxu\\\\\\">performance DMX lighting controller</li></ul>\\", \\"price_equipment\\": \\"80 Gel\\", \\"youtube_link\\": \\"\\", \\"promou_equipment\\": \\"Take control of the atmosphere with our state-of-the-art lighting management systems. Our professional light control solutions empower you to manipulate the ambiance, guiding the audience through a visual journey. From subtle shifts in color to dynamic lighting effects, our advanced technology allows for real-time adjustments, ensuring that every moment is perfectly illuminated. Elevate your event to new heights with the precision and creativity of our lighting director and cutting-edge light control systems\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"37da42aa-2b43-464b-b8e6-2876ea559a74\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"eqipment_cards\\", \\"value\\": {\\"name_equipment\\": \\"Wifi DMX lighting control + iPad\\", \\"pfoto_equipment\\": 529, \\"smallname_equipment\\": \\"DMXlightingcontrol\\", \\"description_equipment\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"c1sr1\\\\\\">ADJ mydmx GO</p>\\", \\"characteristic_equipment\\": \\"<ul><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"17i5m\\\\\\">256 DMX channels</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"9k9e2\\\\\\">Compatible with Ableton-Live</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"ehqq6\\\\\\">DMX via WLAN and USB</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"9b36h\\\\\\">Library of more than 15,000 lighting devices</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"2l56i\\\\\\">Manual channel control</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"aa0f8\\\\\\">Calibration of the light position</li></ul>\\", \\"price_equipment\\": \\"50 Gel\\", \\"youtube_link\\": \\"https://w