ailable for rent in the beautiful city of Batumi\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"cd61670e-fb16-48a1-9e31-aac679a0fb25\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"eqipment_cards\\", \\"value\\": {\\"name_equipment\\": \\"DMX Fog Machine\\", \\"pfoto_equipment\\": 463, \\"smallname_equipment\\": \\"StairvilleAF40DMX\\", \\"description_equipment\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"umi6n\\\\\\"><b>Stairville AF-40 DMX</b></p>\\", \\"characteristic_equipment\\": \\"<ul><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"a3uk1\\\\\\">Mini Smoke Machine with a Very compact fog machine with highly efficient evaporator system and DMX 512 interface</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"5dq61\\\\\\">Great fog output for a tiny fog machine - approximately 85 m\\\\u00b3</li></ul>\\", \\"price_equipment\\": \\"50 Gel\\", \\"youtube_link\\": \\"\\", \\"promou_equipment\\": \\"Create a mesmerizing ambiance for your Batumi event with our top-of-the-line smoke generators available for rent. Whether it's a theatrical production, concert, or special occasion, our dymogenators envelop the surroundings in enchanting fog, adding an extra layer of magic to your experience. Elevate your event by choosing our professional equipment, conveniently available for rent in the heart of Batumi\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"55fae0a8-a9e7-4e7c-87f9-1116aa36a695\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"eqipment_cards\\", \\"value\\": {\\"name_equipment\\": \\"DMX512 controller\\", \\"pfoto_equipment\\": 464, \\"smallname_equipment\\": \\"BotexDC1216\\", \\"description_equipment\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"0fq3l\\\\\\"><b>Botex DC-1216</b></p>\\", \\"characteristic_equipment\\": \\"<ul><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"n3nxu\\\\\\">Scanmaster DMX-512</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"ddrv7\\\\\\">Scan - Controller for 12 scanners with up to 16 DMX - addresses Program memory: 240 scenes (30 banks with 8 scenes each) and 6 chases with loop function Audio, Speed and Fade Control</li></ul>\\", \\"price_equipment\\": \\"20 Gel\\", \\"youtube_link\\": \\"\\", \\"promou_equipment\\": \\"Transform your event into a visual 