 adding vibrant colors and dynamic lighting effects to create an unforgettable atmosphere\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"f9777c9f-fa21-4f81-980b-352eb461808b\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"eqipment_cards\\", \\"value\\": {\\"name_equipment\\": \\"LED Panel\\", \\"pfoto_equipment\\": 521, \\"smallname_equipment\\": \\"ShowTechSunstripA\\\\u0441tiveMKII\\", \\"description_equipment\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"pwyw7\\\\\\">ShowTech Sunstrip A\\\\u0441tive MK II</p>\\", \\"characteristic_equipment\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"9ugpu\\\\\\"></p><ul><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"epl71\\\\\\">Including 10x Osram bulbs</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"6mja5\\\\\\">Lockable menu</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"mafm\\\\\\">10 sections zone control</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"309qi\\\\\\">Manual chase and DMX mode</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"1imp8\\\\\\">Including floor brackets</li></ul>\\", \\"price_equipment\\": \\"75 Gel\\", \\"youtube_link\\": \\"\\", \\"promou_equipment\\": \\"The Sunstrip Active MKII is the successor of the already popular Sunstrip Active. It is equal to the Sunstrip Active however this version offers you some extra features such as: invert function, opportunity to change the logo in the display into your company name, protection function for the mode button and fast addressing. The Sunstrip Active MKII has four DMX modes: 1 channel, 2 channel, 5-channel and 10 channel. For stand-alone applications, the Sunstrip Active MKII is equipped with 16 built-in patterns as well as a manual dimmer. With its Neutrik powerCON in- and output the Sunstrip is suitable for the most demanding users on the road. For easy mounting the Sunstrip Active MKII is equipped with two Wall/Floor brackets as well as several M10 nuts, in order to put your clamp in any desired position. For optimal creativity we recommend the special multibracket (30713).\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"e40f3479-80da-44df-bdd4-b8d4035893de\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"eqipment_cards\\", \\"value\\": {\\"name_equipment\\": \\"Rotating led Heads\\", \\"pfoto_equipment\\": 461, \\"smallname_equipment\\": \\"\\", \\"description_equipment\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"umi6n\\\\\\">Motorized LED Mini Spotlight</p>\\", \\"characteristic_equipment\\": \\"<ul><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"a3uk1\\\\\\">Motorized LED Mini Spotlight (Rotating Head)</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"8mg8d\\\\\\">7 LEDs (8W each)</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"5nqvc\\\\\\">4-in-1 (red, green, blue, white)</li></ul>\\", \\"price_equipment\\": \\"25 Gel/ps\\", \\"youtube_link\\": \\"\\", \\"promou_equipment\\": \\"Elevate the romance on your special day with our exquisite LED spotlights for weddings. Create a magical ambiance, highlight key moments, and turn your wedding into a visually stunning celebration that will be remembered forever\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"fae7635e-ff44-4740-9bc5-a2ce73e0ca7f\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"eqipment_cards\\", \\"value\\": {\\"name_equipment\\": \\"DMX Fog Machine\\", \\"pfoto_equipment\\": 470, \\"smallname_equipment\\": \\"\\", \\"description_equipment\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"umi6n\\\\\\"><b>Stairville AF-150</b></p>\\", \\"characteristic_equipment\\": \\"<ul><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"a3uk1\\\\\\">Heating element: Electronic vaporiser with 800 W</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"1c3q6\\\\\\">Warm-up time: Approximately 8 min</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"8imfs\\\\\\">Fluid consumption: Approximately 33 ml / min</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"7pf7v\\\\\\">Emission volume: Approximately 110 m\\\\u00b3 / min</li></ul>\\", \\"price_equipment\\": \\"60 Gel\\", \\"youtube_link\\": \\"\\", \\"promou_equipment\\": \\"Elevate your event in Batumi with our cutting-edge smoke generators! Transform any space into a captivating scene by renting our high-quality dymogenators. Add a touch of mystique and immerse your audience in an atmosphere that captivates. Make your celebration or performance truly unforgettable with the magic of professional smoke generators, all available for rent in the beautiful city of Batumi\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"cd61670e-fb16-48a1-9e31-aac679a0fb25\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"eqipment_cards\\", \\"value\\": {\\"name_equipment\\": \\"DMX Fog Machine\\", \\"pfoto_equipment\\": 463, \\"smallname_equipment\\": \\"\\", \\"description_equipment\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"umi6n\\\\\\"><b>Stairville AF-40 DMX</b></p>\\", \\"characteristic_equipment\\": \\"<ul><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"a3uk1\\\\\\">Mini Smoke Machine with a Very compact fog machine with highly efficient evaporator system and DMX 512 interface</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"5dq61\\\\\\">Great fog output for a tiny fog machine - approximately 85 m\\\\u00b3</li></ul>\\", \\"price_equipment\\": \\"50 Gel\\", \\"youtube_link\\": \\"\\", \\"promou_equipment\\": \\"Create a mesmerizing ambiance for your Batumi event with our top-of-the-line smoke generators available for rent. Whether it's a theatrical production, concert, or special occasion, our dymogenators envelop the surroundings in enchanting fog, adding an extra layer of magic to your experience. Elevate your event by choosing our professional equipment, conveniently available for rent in the heart of Batumi\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"55fae0a8-a9e7-4e7c-87f9-1116aa36a695\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"eqipment_cards\\", \\"value\\": {\\"name_equipment\\": \\"DMX512 controller\\", \\"pfoto_equipment\\": 464, \\"smallname_equipment\\": \\"\\", \\"description_equipment\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"0fq3l\\\\\\"><b>Botex DC-1216</b></p>\\", \\"characteristic_equipment\\": \\"<ul><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"n3nxu\\\\\\">Scanmaster DMX-512</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"ddrv7\\\\\\">Scan - Controller for 12 scanners with up to 16 DMX - addresses Program memory: 240 scenes (30 banks with 8 scenes each) and 6 chases with loop function Audio, Speed and Fade Control</li></ul>\\", \\"price_equipment\\": \\"20 Gel\\", \\"youtube_link\\": \\"\\", \\"promou_equipment\\": \\"Transform your event into a visual masterpiece with the expertise of our skilled lighting designer. Our seasoned light designer, or 'lighting director,' brings a wealth of experience to curate the perfect illumination for any occasion. From concerts and theatrical performances to weddings and corporate events, our lighting director orchestrates a symphony of colors, intensities, and effects to enhance the mood and ambiance of your venue\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"52f7fe6e-66d3-46f1-b9ef-b03c0b4df675\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"eqipment_cards\\", \\"value\\": {\\"name_equipment\\": \\"pro Controllers\\", \\"pfoto_equipment\\": 467, \\"smallname_equipment\\": \\"\\", \\"description_equipment\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"0fq3l\\\\\\"><b>Wolfmix W1</b></p>\\", \\"characteristic_equipment\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"n3nxu\\\\\\">performance DMX lighting controller</p>\\", \\"price_equipment\\": \\"80 Gel\\", \\"youtube_link\\": \\"\\", \\"promou_equipment\\": \\"Take control of the atmosphere with our state-of-the-art lighting management systems. Our professional light control solutions empower you to manipulate the ambiance, guiding the audience through a visual journey. From subtle shifts in color to dynamic lighting effects, our advanced technology allows for real-time adjustments, ensuring that every moment is perfectly illuminated. Elevate your event to new heights with the precision and creativity of our lighting director and cutting-edge light control systems\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"37da42aa-2b43-464b-b8e6-2876ea559a74\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"eqipment_cards\\", \\"value\\": {\\"name_equipment\\": \\"Wifi DMX lighting control + iPad\\", \\"pfoto_equipment\\": 529, \\"smallname_equipment\\": \\"\\", \\"description_equipment\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"c1sr1\\\\\\">ADJ mydmx GO</p>\\", \\"characteristic_equipment\\": \\"<ul><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"17i5m\\\\\\">256 DMX channels</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"9k9e2\\\\\\">Compatible with Ableton-Live</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"ehqq6\\\\\\">DMX via WLAN and USB</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"9b36h\\\\\\">Library of more than 15,000 lighting devices</li><